    "sub_name": "下世代產業發展概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO NEXT-GENERATION INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程內容以工業工程與系統管理之產業應用為核心議題，連結各項產業之重大技術發展與最新產業發展趨勢",
    "describe_eh": "This course is intended to cover industrial applications of industrial engineering and systems management. The applications such as link to the development of the latest technologies (Intelligent Manufacturing, Internet of Things, Cloud Computing, Big Data Analytics, etc.) and the major trends of industries.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
