      "describe_ch": "理解工業工程與系統管理於智慧製造領域之應用",
      "describe_en": "Understanding Applications of Industrial Engineering and Systems Management to Intelligent Manufacturing"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解工業工程與系統管理與物聯網之應用",
      "describe_en": "Understanding Applications of Industrial Engineering and Systems Management to Internet of Things"
